      "description": "Transform your home with AI and explore fresh design ideas in just a few taps.\nDecorly lets you visualize different interior styles, furniture layouts, colors, and room makeovers from your own photos. Whether you're planning a renovation or simply looking for inspiration, Decorly helps you explore creative possibilities before making changes.\n### Features\n**AI Room Makeovers**\nReimagine bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, bathrooms, offices, and more with AI-generated designs.\n**Multiple Interior Styles**\nExplore Modern, Minimalist, Scandinavian, Japandi, Luxury, Industrial, Boho, Farmhouse, Coastal, and many more.\n**Furniture & Decor Inspiration**\nDiscover fresh ideas for furniture placement, decorations, lighting, and room layouts.\n**Color & Material Exploration**\nTry different wall colors, flooring, textures, and finishes to create a new atmosphere.\n**Easy Photo Transformation**\nUpload a room photo and generate inspiring design concepts in just a few steps.\n**Save & Share**\nKeep your favorite designs and share them with friends and family for inspiration.\nWhether you're refreshing a single room or exploring ideas for your entire home, Decorly makes it easy to discover new interior styles with AI.",
